#   ca "Yes, I owed you my freedom, but I only chose to help you because our relationship was supposed to be mutually beneficial."
    ca "Sim, eu lhe devia minha liberdade, mas só escolhi ajudá-lo porque nosso relacionamento deveria ser mutuamente benéfico."

# game/script6.rpy:1377
