translate brazil dalia2western_3e585868:

#   mc "I can go instead of you, if you want."
    mc "Posso ir em seu lugar, se você quiser."

# game/script6.rpy:9712
translate brazil dalia2western_9f67baf5:

#   d "Nah, it's okay, but thanks for offering." with dis
    d "Não, está tudo bem, mas obrigado por oferecer." with dis

# game/script6.rpy:9714
translate brazil dalia2western_83d74f72:

#   d "It'll be a good chance to improve my horse riding skills."
    d "Será uma boa oportunidade para melhorar minhas habilidades de equitação."

# game/script6.rpy:9716
translate brazil dalia2western_f6c5475c:

#   mc "Yeah, that's a... {i}useful{/i} skill to learn, for sure."
    mc "Sim, essa é uma... habilidade {i}útil{/i} de aprender, com certeza."

# game/script6.rpy:9717
translate brazil dalia2western_9b707f54:

#   mc "Okay then, be careful out there!"
    mc "Ok então, tome cuidado lá fora!"

# game/script6.rpy:9719
translate brazil dalia2western_5b84bc0b:

#   d "Hopefully I'll be back in a few hours... but if I'm not, text me when you log off!"
    d "Espero estar de volta em algumas horas... mas se não estiver, me mande uma mensagem quando sair!"

# game/script6.rpy:9721
translate brazil dalia2western_0cf71cc6:

#   mc "Will do!"
    mc "Vai fazer!"

# game/script6.rpy:9722
translate brazil dalia2western_1ceef007:

#   mc "Good luck, Dalia."
    mc "Boa sorte, Dália."

# game/script6.rpy:9724
translate brazil dalia2western_d6ef440a:

#   d "You too!"
    d "Você também!"

# game/script6.rpy:9726
translate brazil dalia2western_3798e3ab:

#   mct "Hmmm... while she's doing this, I might as well scout around town. Who knows, I might stumble upon something useful."
    mct "Hmmm... enquanto ela está fazendo isso, é melhor eu explorar a cidade. Quem sabe eu possa encontrar algo útil."

# game/script6.rpy:9727
translate brazil dalia2western_a6241728:

#   mct "Where are you, Coyote..."
    mct "Onde está você, Coiote..."

# game/script6.rpy:9730
translate brazil dalia2western_6287fda8:

#   d "Um..."
    d "Um..."

# game/script6.rpy:9731
translate brazil dalia2western_9a9a77df:

#   d "I mean... I guess, it's a big horse."
    d "Quero dizer... acho que é um cavalo grande."

# game/script6.rpy:9732
translate brazil dalia2western_f6583458:

#   d "But I'm not sure if I'll be able to control it with both of us on its back."
    d "Mas não tenho certeza se conseguirei controlá-lo com nós dois nas costas."

# game/script6.rpy:9734
translate brazil dalia2western_db484871:

#   mc "Then let me take the reins!"
    mc "Então deixe-me tomar as rédeas!"

# game/script6.rpy:9735
translate brazil dalia2western_684bb75e:

#   mc "I'm an experienced horse rider, don't worry."
    mc "Sou um cavaleiro experiente, não se preocupe."

# game/script6.rpy:9737
translate brazil dalia2western_50c6606a:

#   d "*Chuckles* An experienced horse rider? Since when?" with dis
    d "*Risos* Um cavaleiro experiente? Desde quando?" with dis

# game/script6.rpy:9738
translate brazil dalia2western_43df284a:

#   d "Have you ever ridden a horse before?"
    d "Você já andou a cavalo antes?"

# game/script6.rpy:9740
translate brazil dalia2western_497a9456:

#   mc "I rode a donkey at a medieval fair when I was 12. I assume it'll be pretty much the same."
    mc "Montei um burro em uma feira medieval quando tinha 12 anos. Presumo que será praticamente a mesma coisa."

# game/script6.rpy:9741
translate brazil dalia2western_7bf638a5:

#   mc "The carny said, and I quote, that I had “a gift worthy of Sir Richard the Lionheart”."
    mc "O carny disse, e passo a citar, que eu tinha “um presente digno de Sir Ricardo Coração de Leão”."

# game/script6.rpy:9742
translate brazil dalia2western_5fc2b5b3:

#   mc "I don't lie, you can ask Annie."
    mc "Eu não minto, você pode perguntar a Annie."

# game/script6.rpy:9744
translate brazil dalia2western_906a442a:

#   d "*Snorts* I {i}will{/i} ask her, you can be sure."
    d "*Bufa* Eu {i}vou{/i} perguntar a ela, pode ter certeza."

# game/script6.rpy:9745
translate brazil dalia2western_654fe82e:

#   d "That's a story I don't wanna miss."
    d "Essa é uma história que não quero perder."

# game/script6.rpy:9746
translate brazil dalia2western_3a41ff5d:

#   d "But alright, show me your “gift”, Lionheart. Let's ride together."
    d "Mas tudo bem, mostre-me o seu “presente”, Lionheart. Vamos cavalgar juntos."

# game/script6.rpy:9748
translate brazil dalia2western_a6d7db3e:

#   mc "With pleasure!"
    mc "Com prazer!"

# game/script6.rpy:9753
translate brazil dalia2western_4996a254:

#   bla "You effortlessly mount the horse in one jump and extend your hand to Dalia." with dis06
    bla "Você monta no cavalo sem esforço com um salto e estende a mão para Dalia." with dis06

# game/script6.rpy:9755
translate brazil dalia2western_f60c1376:

#   mc "C'mon!"
    mc "Vamos!"

# game/script6.rpy:9757
translate brazil dalia2western_5caec930:

#   d "O-Okay! Let's go."
    d "O-ok! Vamos."

# game/script6.rpy:9758
translate brazil dalia2western_ef594f69:

#   d "W-Where am I supposed to put my foot? There's no stirrup."
    d "Onde devo colocar meu pé? Não há estribo."

# game/script6.rpy:9760
translate brazil dalia2western_7b504778:

#   mc "Don't worry about that, just take my hand and I'll pull you up."
    mc "Não se preocupe com isso, apenas pegue minha mão e eu te puxarei para cima."

# game/script6.rpy:9762
translate brazil dalia2western_91d08706:

#   d "O-Okay."
    d "Ok."

# game/script6.rpy:9767
translate brazil dalia2western_8efd97e8:

#   d "O-Oh boy." with dissolve
    d "O-Oh garoto." with dissolve

# game/script6.rpy:9768
translate brazil dalia2western_49c5930e:

#   d "This looks taller than I expected."
    d "Isso parece mais alto do que eu esperava."

# game/script6.rpy:9770
translate brazil dalia2western_b8d62428:

#   mc "Are you scared of horses?"
    mc "Você tem medo de cavalos?"

# game/script6.rpy:9771
translate brazil dalia2western_75b8f477:

#   mc "Is that why you don't have one in Ekabar?"
    mc "É por isso que você não tem um em Ekabar?"

# game/script6.rpy:9773
translate brazil dalia2western_12ffb3d4:

#   d "I'm not scared of them!"
    d "Eu não tenho medo deles!"

# game/script6.rpy:9774
translate brazil dalia2western_347c95ff:

#   d "I just... respect them."
    d "Eu apenas... os respeito."

# game/script6.rpy:9776
translate brazil dalia2western_014f049c:

#   mc "You need to lose this fear, you'll never embrace your inner Rohirrim otherwise."
    mc "Você precisa perder esse medo, caso contrário, nunca abraçará seu Rohirrim interior."

# game/script6.rpy:9778
translate brazil dalia2western_fd6555f2:

#   d "I said I'm not sca–"
    d "Eu disse que não estou com medo"

# game/script6.rpy:9785
translate brazil dalia2western_2254de6b:

#   bla "You crack the reins and pop off towards the canyon the sheriff mentioned." with dis
    bla "Você estala as rédeas e sai em direção ao desfiladeiro que o xerife mencionou." with dis

# game/script6.rpy:9786
translate brazil dalia2western_b72a35a3:

#   d "SLOW DOWN!" with hpunch
    d "DESACELERAR!" with hpunch

# game/script6.rpy:9787
translate brazil dalia2western_4e926295:

#   mc "Go Roach!"
    mc "Vai barata!"

# game/script6.rpy:9796
translate brazil dalia2western_42b5d7b4:

#   mc "*Sighs* Aaaaaand... more red rock." with dis08
    mc "*Suspiros* Aaaaae... mais pedra vermelha." with dis08

# game/script6.rpy:9797
translate brazil dalia2western_6408b440:

#   mc "Man, this server is as huge as all the others."
    mc "Cara, esse servidor é tão grande quanto todos os outros."

# game/script6.rpy:9803
translate brazil dalia2western_69eba1b4:

#   mc "*Resuming the march* I hope we didn't take a wrong turn." with dis12
    mc "*Retomando a marcha* Espero que não tenhamos tomado o caminho errado." with dis12

# game/script6.rpy:9804
translate brazil dalia2western_c6533df6:

#   mc "Are there any other towns in this server, apart from Blackridge?"
    mc "Existem outras cidades neste servidor além de Blackridge?"

# game/script6.rpy:9805
translate brazil dalia2western_d20a7046:

#   d ". . ."
    d ". . ."

# game/script6.rpy:9806
translate brazil dalia2western_0e692270:

#   mc "Dalia? Did you fall asleep back there?"
    mc "Dália? Você adormeceu aí atrás?"

# game/script6.rpy:9808
translate brazil dalia2western_5f5f620b:

#   d "E-Eh?" with dissolve
    d "E-Huh?" with dissolve

# game/script6.rpy:9810
translate brazil dalia2western_308ca3df:

#   d "Ah, no, I'm here."
    d "Ah, não, estou aqui."

# game/script6.rpy:9811
translate brazil dalia2western_8a3bc83b:

#   d "Um... yeah, there are a lot of them."
    d "Hum... sim, há muitos deles."

# game/script6.rpy:9812
translate brazil dalia2western_1231477e:

#   d "I haven't explored it much, but Alex told me there are dozens of towns, and even a big main city down south."
    d "Não a explorei muito, mas Alex me disse que há dezenas de cidades, e até mesmo uma grande cidade principal no sul."

# game/script6.rpy:9813
translate brazil dalia2western_06441591:

#   d "Most of them are connected by train."
    d "A maioria deles está conectada por trem."

# game/script6.rpy:9815
translate brazil dalia2western_cd520364:

#   d "We just came to Blackridge because it's where El Coyote is hiding."
    d "Viemos para Blackridge porque é onde El Coyote está escondido."

# game/script6.rpy:9816
translate brazil dalia2western_d684f450:

#   d "Allegedly."
    d "Alegadamente."

# game/script6.rpy:9818
translate brazil dalia2western_2a9c617c:

#   mc "Damn, that's crazy. I wonder how many online players there must be on average."
    mc "Droga, isso é loucura. Eu me pergunto quantos jogadores online deve haver em média."

# game/script6.rpy:9820
translate brazil dalia2western_93a21a34:

#   d "Who knows. Just in Blackridge there must be like... 100 people? Maybe 200 on weekends."
    d "Quem sabe. Só em Blackridge deve haver umas... 100 pessoas? Talvez 200 nos fins de semana."

# game/script6.rpy:9822
translate brazil dalia2western_f6eb606d:

#   d "In all Frontier Trails... probably thousands."
    d "Em todas as Frontier Trails... provavelmente milhares."

# game/script6.rpy:9824
translate brazil dalia2western_448f1977:

#   d "And that's without including the NPCs."
    d "E isso sem incluir os NPCs."

# game/script6.rpy:9827
translate brazil dalia2western_fe982ec1:

#   mc "Yeah, I found out about that earlier."
    mc "Sim, descobri isso antes."

# game/script6.rpy:9828
translate brazil dalia2western_2cb68fa3:

#   mc "I was with Alex and we had an incident with some weirdo and an NPC. It was a kid, so... you can imagine which way the wind was blowing."
    mc "Eu estava com Alex e tivemos um incidente com um estranho e um NPC. Era uma criança, então... você pode imaginar para que lado soprava o vento."

# game/script6.rpy:9830
translate brazil dalia2western_c9b3ef96:

#   d "Ugh, that sounds awful."
    d "Ugh, isso parece horrível."

# game/script6.rpy:9832
translate brazil dalia2western_688b66d9:

#   mc "Oh, it {i}was{/i} bad, believe me."
    mc "Ah, isso {i}era{/i} ruim, acredite em mim."

# game/script6.rpy:9834
translate brazil dalia2western_7957edb2:

#   mc "What? Are there NPCs in Frontier Trails?"
    mc "O que? Existem NPCs em Frontier Trails?"

# game/script6.rpy:9836
translate brazil dalia2western_9abc9ea2:

#   d "Yeah, I think so. You know how the whole goal of Eternum is to be as immersive as possible."
    d "Sim, acho que sim. Você sabe que o objetivo do Eternum é ser o mais envolvente possível."

# game/script6.rpy:9837
translate brazil dalia2western_6ea5c5c3:

#   d "There are usually some NPCs scattered throughout the servers like these to prevent the worlds from feeling empty."
    d "Geralmente existem alguns NPCs espalhados pelos servidores como esses para evitar que os mundos pareçam vazios."

# game/script6.rpy:9839
translate brazil dalia2western_27548097:

#   d "They can be interacted with, although they don't carry anything valuable and they can't harm players, so most people just ignore them."
    d "É possível interagir com eles, embora não carreguem nada de valioso e não possam prejudicar os jogadores, então a maioria das pessoas simplesmente os ignora."

# game/script6.rpy:9840
translate brazil dalia2western_66320cde:

#   d "In this case I think they're limited to some ranchers between the main towns."
    d "Neste caso acho que estão limitados a alguns fazendeiros entre as principais cidades."

# game/script6.rpy:9842
translate brazil dalia2western_054c5ee0:

#   mc "I see."
    mc "Eu vejo."

# game/script6.rpy:9843
translate brazil dalia2western_f269d160:

#   mc "It's crazy when you think about it, you know?"
    mc "É uma loucura pensar nisso, sabe?"

# game/script6.rpy:9844
translate brazil dalia2western_4a01f7d1:

#   mc "I see it very differently now."
    mc "Eu vejo isso de forma muito diferente agora."

# game/script6.rpy:9846
translate brazil dalia2western_2c3a63c7:

#   d "What do you mean?"
    d "O que você quer dizer?"

# game/script6.rpy:9848
translate brazil dalia2western_944b136d:

#   mc "The NPCs."
    mc "Os NPCs."

# game/script6.rpy:9849
translate brazil dalia2western_8cc32a5e:

#   mc "They're all there... doing their things... even if there isn't any human player to observe them in a 10-mile radius."
    mc "Eles estão todos lá... fazendo suas coisas... mesmo que não haja nenhum jogador humano para observá-los em um raio de 16 quilômetros."

# game/script6.rpy:9851
translate brazil dalia2western_d448956b:

#   d "Well, we don't know that. Maybe they simply freeze in place when no one's around."
    d "Bem, não sabemos disso. Talvez eles simplesmente congelem quando não há ninguém por perto."

# game/script6.rpy:9852
translate brazil dalia2western_5df5f875:

#   d "Like in Toy Story, but the other way around."
    d "Como em Toy Story, mas ao contrário."

# game/script6.rpy:9854
translate brazil dalia2western_1411bb95:

#   mc "*Chuckles* Maybe."
    mc "*Risos* Talvez."

# game/script6.rpy:9855
translate brazil dalia2western_4aac0bf3:

#   mc "Do you ever wonder if all the NPCs were once real people? Like Thanatos?"
    mc "Você já se perguntou se todos os NPCs já foram pessoas reais? Como Tânatos?"

# game/script6.rpy:9857
translate brazil dalia2western_5b94043f:

#   d "Uhh... huh, I didn't think about it, but it seems unlikely."
    d "Uhh... huh, não pensei nisso, mas parece improvável."

# game/script6.rpy:9858
translate brazil dalia2western_65ae957b:

#   d "Just the thought of it sounds quite dreadful, doesn't it?"
    d "Só de pensar nisso parece horrível, não é?"

# game/script6.rpy:9860
translate brazil dalia2western_54f26235:

#   mc "Yeah... it really does."
    mc "Sim... realmente importa."

# game/script6.rpy:9861
translate brazil dalia2western_ece38b12:

#   mc "But you're right, there's no way Ulysses managed to cover so many disappearances."
    mc "Mas você tem razão, Ulisses não conseguiu encobrir tantos desaparecimentos."

# game/script6.rpy:9863
translate brazil dalia2western_6872a46f:

#   d "Unless... Ulysses found a way to brainwash and control people from a parallel dimension and bring them here."
    d "A menos que... Ulisses tenha encontrado uma maneira de fazer lavagem cerebral e controlar as pessoas de uma dimensão paralela e trazê-las para cá."

# game/script6.rpy:9865
translate brazil dalia2western_a3b35723:

#   mc "Honestly? We've reached a stage where that wouldn't even surprise me."
    mc "Honestamente? Chegamos a um ponto em que isso nem me surpreenderia."

# game/script6.rpy:9866
translate brazil dalia2western_4a12eef6:

#   mc "If I were to wake up tomorrow inside a Matrix pod, surrounded by tubes connected to me, I'd probably just nod and say “Oh, well, that actually makes sense, yeah”."
    mc "Se eu acordasse amanhã dentro de uma cápsula Matrix, cercada por tubos conectados a mim, provavelmente apenas acenaria com a cabeça e diria \"Oh, bem, isso realmente faz sentido, sim\"."

# game/script6.rpy:9868
translate brazil dalia2western_57f8e593:

#   d "*Laughs* Yeah, I'd probably react the same way."
    d "*Risos* Sim, provavelmente reagiria da mesma maneira."

# game/script6.rpy:9873
translate brazil dalia2western_733eb3b2:

#   mc "*Stopping the horse* Finally!" with dissolve
    mc "*Parando o cavalo* Finalmente!" with dissolve

# game/script6.rpy:9874
translate brazil dalia2western_3c21c044:

#   mc "Are you seeing what I'm seeing?!"
    mc "Você está vendo o que eu estou vendo?!"

# game/script6.rpy:9878
translate brazil dalia2western_f7381572:

#   d "Oh fuck..." with dis
    d "Ah, porra..." with dis

# game/script6.rpy:9879
translate brazil dalia2western_75245aed:

#   mc "I know, right?? That's gotta be the damn cabin!"
    mc "Eu sei direito?? Deve ser a maldita cabana!"

# game/script6.rpy:9880
translate brazil dalia2western_e4548e31:

#   d "Um... [mc]?"
    d "Hum... [mc]?"

# game/script6.rpy:9881
translate brazil dalia2western_faf57d71:

#   mc "Okay, we don't know if there's anyone inside."
    mc "Ok, não sabemos se há alguém lá dentro."

# game/script6.rpy:9882
translate brazil dalia2western_df2a67d8:

#   d "[mc]..."
    d "[mc]..."

# game/script6.rpy:9883
translate brazil dalia2western_6a6c99db:

#   mc "Let's leave the horse here and..."
    mc "Vamos deixar o cavalo aqui e..."

# game/script6.rpy:9889
translate brazil dalia2western_d73e7b6d:

#   bla "Dalia grabs your head with her hands and turns it towards the massive sandstorm rolling in from the west." with dis14
    bla "Dalia agarra sua cabeça com as mãos e a vira em direção à enorme tempestade de areia que vem do oeste." with dis14

# game/script6.rpy:9890
translate brazil dalia2western_1018841b:

#   mc "W-What the fuck is that?"
    mc "Que porra é essa?"

# game/script6.rpy:9891
translate brazil dalia2western_cf92a3d3:

#   d "A sandstorm! Coming this way!"
    d "Uma tempestade de areia! Vindo por aqui!"

# game/script6.rpy:9892
translate brazil dalia2western_5a3765d8:

#   mc "Oh shit."
    mc "Ah Merda."

# game/script6.rpy:9893
translate brazil dalia2western_bc7455b4:

#   mc "What's gonna happen to us if we stay in the open?"
    mc "O que vai acontecer conosco se ficarmos abertos?"

# game/script6.rpy:9894
translate brazil dalia2western_7cc6327c:

#   d "We die!"
    d "Nós morremos!"

# game/script6.rpy:9896
translate brazil dalia2western_a6ebc14f:

#   mc "FUCK!" with dis
    mc "PORRA!" with dis

# game/script6.rpy:9897
translate brazil dalia2western_6595c343:

#   mc "Should we go to the cabin?"
    mc "Devemos ir para a cabana?"

# game/script6.rpy:9898
translate brazil dalia2western_bd1b2c72:

#   d "What? I can't hear you!"
    d "O que? Eu não consigo ouvir você!"

# game/script6.rpy:9899
translate brazil dalia2western_fd4633e7:

#   mc "SHOULD WE GO TO THE CABIN?!"
    mc "DEVEMOS IR PARA A CABINE?!"

# game/script6.rpy:9900
translate brazil dalia2western_1496ee88:

#   d "WE SHOULD GO TO THE CABIN IF WE DON'T WANNA DIE!"
    d "DEVEMOS IR PARA A CABINE SE NÃO QUEREMOS MORRER!"

# game/script6.rpy:9901
translate brazil dalia2western_9200cbba:

#   mc "I CAN'T HEAR YOU, LET'S GO TO THE CABIN!"
    mc "NÃO CONSIGO TE OUVIR, VAMOS PARA A CABINE!"

# game/script6.rpy:9902
translate brazil dalia2western_364d5a56:

#   mct "Holy fuck, this thing is moving fast... we better hurry."
    mct "Puta merda, essa coisa está andando rápido... é melhor nos apressarmos."

# game/script6.rpy:9908
translate brazil dalia2western_2496d615:

#   d "OKAY, I LEFT THE HORSE IN THAT SHED OVER THERE!" with dissolve
    d "OK, DEIXEI O CAVALO NAQUELE galpão ali!" with dissolve

# game/script6.rpy:9909
translate brazil dalia2western_642666e6:

#   mc "ALRIGHT, LET'S GO INSIDE!"
    mc "OK, VAMOS PARA DENTRO!"

# game/script6.rpy:9910
translate brazil dalia2western_32b2055b:

#   d "OKAY!"
    d "OK!"

# game/script6.rpy:9912
translate brazil dalia2western_e8696307:

#   mc "*Knocking on the door* HELLO? ANYBODY THERE??" with hpunch
    mc "*batendo na porta* OLÁ? ALGUÉM AÍ??" with hpunch

# game/script6.rpy:9913
translate brazil dalia2western_7a318312:

#   bla ". . ."
    bla ". . ."

# game/script6.rpy:9914
translate brazil dalia2western_a9b4d115:

#   mc "I THINK IT'S EMPTY!"
    mc "ACHO QUE ESTÁ VAZIO!"

# game/script6.rpy:9915
translate brazil dalia2western_29e4ae21:

#   mc "I'LL OPEN THE DOOR, WATCH OUT!"
    mc "VOU ABRIR A PORTA, CUIDADO!"

# game/script6.rpy:9916
translate brazil dalia2western_d0b15886:

#   mc "*Taking a run-up* Haaa..."
    mc "*Dando uma corrida* Haaa..."

# game/script6.rpy:9923
