translate brazil westernending_d8643c3f:

#   x "Nice job. At least we got something."
    x "Bom trabalho. Pelo menos conseguimos alguma coisa."

# game/script6.rpy:12166
translate brazil westernending_598cc3fc:

#   mc "Dalia went with him to get the info, and she was supposed to use another Exit Portal after that."
    mc "Dalia foi com ele para obter as informações e deveria usar outro Portal de Saída depois disso."

