translate brazil westernending_1fb3ac25:

#   bi "If you force us to act, though... we might have to kill her too."
    bi "Se você nos forçar a agir... talvez tenhamos que matá-la também."

# game/script6.rpy:12271
translate brazil westernending_97ebef28:

#   bi "Unless she wants to have a couple of drinks with us at the saloon."
    bi "A menos que ela queira tomar alguns drinks conosco no bar."

